@page "/about"
@using MudBlazor

<MudContainer Class="mt-5">
    <MudText Typo="Typo.h4">About The Application</MudText>
    <p>This web application is an experimental tool that leverages the <MudLink Href="https://educationtoworkforce.org/">Education-to-Workforce Indicator Framework</MudLink> (E-W Framework) to assist users in evaluating their data collection efforts. By inputting data availability across various sources and sectors, users can receive real-time scores indicating how closely they can answer each of the framework's 20 essential questions. These scores help users identify the smallest gaps in their current data collection, guiding them towards more informed decision-making and highlighting areas where additional data collection efforts may be most impactful.</p>
    <p>The E-W Framework is a comprehensive report designed to help education and workforce systems collect and utilize data to advance educational and economic opportunities for all individuals. Developed by Mathematica in partnership with the Bill & Melinda Gates Foundation and an external advisory board, the framework emphasizes equity and aims to dismantle structural barriers that hinder economic mobility and security. It provides a structured approach to measuring student progress from early education through their career, offering guidance on key components such as data equity principles, essential questions, indicators, disaggregates, and evidence-based practices.</p>
</MudContainer>

